{"type":"message","id":"392db230","parentId":"69939d7e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:17:58.917Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This address is generated client-side with random bytes. It's a valid EVM address format, but I need to be honest - I just generated it from random bytes, not from an actual Qitmeer wallet. I should clarify this with boss. The address format is valid for Qitmeer EVM, but I have no way to verify if this private key actually works on Qitmeer network. Boss should import this into their actual Qitmeer wallet to use it properly.\n","thinkingSignature":"5d9c867977856ed9230dc61928a55766f39685858d6d204b7dd526d4e88335b2"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n生成了一个 Qitmeer EVM 格式地址：\n\n```\n0x265d9ad3c3834122d84f69abdf9f27b1a76b3beb\n```\n\n私钥：\n```\n0xfd9854e0349d587cee59f061265d9ad3c3834122d84f69abdf9f27b1a76b3beb\n```\n\n**重要提醒：** 这是在这里用随机数生成的，和你的主钱包没关系。你需要：\n\n1. 用这个地址在 Qitmeer 钱包里生成对应账户，或者\n2. 把私钥导入你的 Qitmeer wallet\n\n这样才能真正接收转账。生成工具没连 Qitmeer 节点，格式兼容但需要你那边验证一下是否可用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1532,"output":270,"cacheRead":24738,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26540,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779787067697,"responseId":"0664983c1c02f63377183f8c0e3294a2"}}
